* u3 net-_u2-pad7_ net-_u2-pad8_ net-_u2-pad9_ net-_u2-pad10_ y3 y2 y1 y0 dac_bridge_4
* u7 y0 plot_v1
v3 a0 gnd pulse(0 3.3 0 1n 1n 5n 10n)
v2 s1 gnd pulse(0 3.3 0 1n 1n 160n 320n)
v1 s0 gnd pulse(0 3.3 0 1n 1n 80n 160n)
